1
00:00:00,044 --> 00:00:02,754
(Penny:)The owner then says,
"Lots of women come in here every day.

2
00:00:02,964 --> 00:00:06,254
Why don't you buy an ice cream for them,
and they might fall in love?"

3
00:00:06,467 --> 00:00:07,677
And the physicist says:

4
00:00:07,885 --> 00:00:10,975
"Yeah, but what are
the odds of that happening?" Ha.

5
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,480
That's a little insulting, don't you think?

6
00:00:18,938 --> 00:00:21,818
(Penny:)How would I know?
I'm not even sure I get it.

7
00:00:23,484 --> 00:00:24,984
(Alicia:)Hey, Leonard?

8
00:00:25,194 --> 00:00:28,154
(Alicia:)If you're done with the DVD player,
can you set up my printer?

9
00:00:28,322 --> 00:00:29,652
Oh, yeah, I'd love to.

10
00:00:31,367 --> 00:00:33,997
(Penny:)When you're done with her printer,
you could set up mine.

11
00:00:34,203 --> 00:00:36,493
(Penny:)You know, like you promised,
a week ago?

12
00:00:36,706 --> 00:00:38,496
(Leonard:)Yeah, I'll get to it. Don't nag me.

13
00:00:42,336 --> 00:00:44,336
(Raj(drinking some wine):)Hello, there.

14
00:00:49,343 --> 00:00:51,343
[MUSIC PLAYS OVER TV]

15
00:00:55,057 --> 00:01:00,027
[MAN SPEAKS INDISTINCTLY
OVER TV]

